  dct:description """Introduction
Vattenfall has started the preparation for a tender on the provisioning and delivery of Peripherals and Mobile Devices. As a first step in this process we have defined a written, open and non-interactive Market Consultation to consult potential suppliers on key questions. By this approach Vattenfall aims to take full advantage of the market capabilities.
"""@en;
